---
import Editorial from '../layouts/Editorial.astro';
import { legalPolicy } from '../config/legal';
---

<Editorial
  title="Contact & corrections."
  description="Contact Tagrivo for editorial questions, product corrections and privacy enquiries. An independent editorial project by JC Labs."
>
  <p>
    Tagrivo is an independent editorial project focused on thermal label printer recommendations and
    comparisons. It is one of the projects developed under JC Labs, a personal brand for digital
    projects.
  </p>
  <p>
    An individual based in Peru administers Tagrivo under that personal brand, serving an audience
    primarily in the United States. Tagrivo and JC Labs are not presented as incorporated companies.
  </p>
  <h2>Get in touch.</h2>
  <p>
    For editorial questions, corrections or privacy enquiries, email{' '}
    <a href="mailto:hello.jclabs@gmail.com">hello.jclabs@gmail.com</a>.
  </p>
  <h2>What helps us assess a correction</h2>
  <p>
    A useful correction should identify the Tagrivo page, exact printer variant, statement in
    question, and a public manufacturer or platform source. Avoid including customer addresses,
    shipping labels, account credentials or private order details.
  </p>
  <p>
    The <a href="/methodology/">editorial methodology</a> explains how we distinguish
    specifications, research and unverified workflows. For the current implementation and unresolved
    operator details, read the{' '}
    <a href="/privacy/">{legalPolicy.approved ? 'privacy policy' : 'provisional privacy notice'}</a>
    .
  </p>
  <p>
    Correspondence is used to respond to your enquiry or correction, not to send advertising without
    permission. The retention rule is 12 months from the last communication, subject to applicable
    legal obligations and deletion requests. Review and deletion are manual; see{' '}
    <a href="/privacy/#email-retention">email retention and your rights</a>.
  </p>
</Editorial>
